00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:53.790
some of them may be
allowing to get our minds

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:55.170
out of the crisis.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:56.600
So that's what this is.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:59.870
And I like to remind everyone,
we are not for profit.

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:01.870
We can only do this work
and everything else we do

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:03.330
because of philanthropic donations.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:04.920
So if you're in a position to do so,

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.800
please think about making a donation

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.290
I do wanna give a special shout out

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:10.540
