00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:38.710
So if you're in a position to do so,

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:40.419
please think about
donating so that many many

00:01:40.419 --> 00:01:42.610
millions of folks around
the world can continue

00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:44.753
to benefit from from this work.

00:01:44.753 --> 00:01:49.080
