So you can imagine what we
might be talking about today.

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:06.920
So Adam, great to have you here.

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:07.753
- Thank you, Sal.

00:02:07.753 --> 00:02:10.803
It's so nice to see you and
to connect with you today.

